    <string name="translator_help">Type or speak: write, paste or say a sentence and read it in another language. Read the translation aloud or copy it.\nUnder From, pick the language the text is in: with another one, the translation can make no sense.\nManage languages… at the end of each list: check the languages you want, and get or delete their packs, speech and voices. Basic quality ones translate less well.\nConversation: two people take turns, each in their own language, on two halves of the screen. Lay the phone between you.\nThe first time, a language needs its pack (about 70 MB). Once it's on the phone, translating works without the internet.\nSpeaking and reading aloud use the phone's own speech and voices, so they depend on the phone. Typing always works.\nFor travel and everyday talk, not for medical or legal texts.</string>
